---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /seminars/
title: "Holotropic Breathwork Seminars & Intensives — Archive since 2024"
description: "Every residential seminar and Holotropic Breathwork intensive of the Transpersonal Training, past and upcoming: Todtmoos near Freiburg, Tuscany, Moldova, Riga and more."
---
{% set all = scheduleEvents | seminarList %}
{% set heroImage = '/assets/images/Headers/hero-schedule-todtmoos-valley' %}
{% set heroAlt = 'The green Black Forest valley around the seminar house at Todtmoos' %}
{% set kicker = 'Seminars & intensives' %}
{% set heading = 'Every seminar, by year' %}
{% set subheading = all.length + ' residential seminars and Holotropic Breathwork weekends since 2024' %}
{% include "detail-hero.njk" %}

<div class="bg-[color:var(--c-paper-card)] border-b border-[color:var(--c-line)]">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="container mx-auto px-6 py-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--c-body-dim)]">
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="hover:text-[color:var(--c-link)] transition-colors">Home</a>
            <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
            <span class="text-[color:var(--c-heading)] font-medium">Seminars</span>
        </div>
    </nav>
</div>

<section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-[color:var(--c-paper-hi)]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
            <p class="text-lg text-[color:var(--c-body)] leading-relaxed mb-10">
                The residential part of the training: intensives that pair a seminar topic with Holotropic Breathwork sessions, and optional breathwork weekends for extra practice. Most take place at the Haus am Mühlenbach in Todtmoos, in the Black Forest near Freiburg; others in Tuscany, Moldova, Latvia, Romania and Italy. For filters and the current season see the <a href="{{ '/schedule/' | url }}" class="text-[color:var(--c-link)] underline underline-offset-4">intensive schedule</a>.
            </p>
            {% for y in all | seminarYears %}
            <h2 class="p4-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-[color:var(--c-heading)] mt-12 mb-4">{{ y }}</h2>
            <ul class="divide-y divide-[color:var(--c-line)] border-y border-[color:var(--c-line)]">
                {% for s in all %}{% if (s.range.start.slice(0, 4) if s.range else 'Date to be defined') == y %}
                <li>
                    <a href="{{ s.url | url }}" class="group flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1 sm:gap-6 py-3 hover:bg-[color:var(--c-paper)] transition-colors">
                        <span class="text-sm text-[color:var(--c-body-dim)] sm:w-52 flex-shrink-0">{{ s.dateText }}</span>
                        <span class="flex-1">
                            <span class="font-medium text-[color:var(--c-heading)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--c-link)]">{{ s.cleanTitle }}</span>
                            <span class="block text-sm text-[color:var(--c-body-dim)]">{{ [s.placeName, s.city, s.country] | compact | join(' · ') }}{% if s.facilitators.length %} — {{ s.facilitators | names }}{% endif %}</span>
                        </span>
                        {% if s.range and not s.isPast %}<span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[color:var(--c-acc-40)] text-[color:var(--c-sec)] self-start">Upcoming</span>{% endif %}
                    </a>
                </li>
                {% endif %}{% endfor %}
            </ul>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
